
### a config lock left behind is reported, not removed
$ git stack create feat-a
error: git config is locked by '<repo>/.git/config.lock'.
If no git command is running, a killed one left it behind; remove it and re-run.
[exit 1]
lock still there: yes

### a config lock released during the retries is waited out
$ git stack create feat-a
created feat-a on top of main
[exit 0]
feat-a parent: main
feat-a base == main: yes

### a failed unset is not mistaken for the lock
$ git stack untrack
'feat-a' is no longer tracked in a stack
[exit 0]
